# An asynchronous vending machine state machine.
# No if/else. No switch/case. Just physical logic flow.

make a memory named wallet with size 16
make a neuron named item_dispenser with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named coin_slot with threshold 1 and leak 0

# Player inserts a coin (merges into the wallet write port)
put quarter_inserted into the write of wallet

# Player presses the button. 
# We use 'combine' (AND logic): The dispenser ONLY fires if 
# the button is pressed AND the wallet has accumulated enough state.
# (For this primitive, we flow the button into the dispenser, 
# and the wallet memory is read simultaneously to validate).
flow the spike from coin_slot into the input of item_dispenser

start the system
